{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0jXH3nT9df8C__1sF1n80g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:21.458641+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0jXH3nT9df8C__1sF1n80g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqP8RtTSFw4xd5XSQyOcmf9CDhHC3Ipn0okSBxtH0xujEzZu6GsfsFG5vFialx05fqGkAPFqRU42VDQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxU9yXicmZjNqyHe9ricOiahAfZRH7j4B28kicP8KUHQSibIAia9sqorkiagVKPA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为拓展优秀研究生生源，同时为全国优秀大学生提供学习、交流及报考咨询的平台，北京协和医学院放射医学研究所将于7月中旬在天津举办2025年“全国优秀大学生夏令营活动”，作为招收推荐免试研究生（包括推荐免试硕士生、直接攻博生）的预选拔方式之一。欢迎各位优秀大学生踊跃报名参加我单位夏令营，进一步了解招生专业和导师，申请推免或报考我单位。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>北京协和医学院简介</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUGooPiaP1hDvJocubM7b5t0ictO7o1IxibkzuT4rZREUpicibVxFhogT2B5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>中国医学科学院成立于1956年，北京协和医学院建校于1917年。中国医学科学院-北京协和医学院自1957年起实行院校合一的管理体制（以下简称“院校”），是我国最高医学研究机构和最高医学教育机构。院校始终牢记初心使命，以我国医学科技教育发展和维护人民健康为己任，教育人才辈出，科研硕果累累，医疗领衔行业，为我国现代科学医学体系的建立和发展做出了重要贡献。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>放射医学研究所简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxU1icDTr7ibw4WPEweLiarat4p5iaZvcicbDtqrSmTHQAe9FHjjTNlgIHr9SA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>放射医学研究所于1959年成立，是我国卫生系统中最早从事放射医学与核医学研究的专业机构。是我国放射医学、辐射防护与损伤救治、实验核医学创新研究国家级科研机构。研究所现在有博士导师19人，硕士导师28人，国家杰出青年3名、长江学者1名，国家优秀青年2名，国家青年拔尖1名，享受政府特殊津贴专家3名，天津市杰出青年5名，天津市突出贡献专家3名，天津千人计划获得者2名，天津131创新型人才第一层次人选4名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUjdf3wxPHooibYKBiaOWQxEicPibK3IuGYP19ZaapjkpsKUfr901JYiaspVg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>研究所是我国放射医学及实验核医学人才的培养基地，已培养400余名博士和硕士研究生。面向国家重大需求和人民生命健康，专注于放射医学、核医学、环境医学关键科学问题和新兴前沿领域，以基础理论突破、关键技术攻关、实用成果转化为导向开展研究工作，形成了特色鲜明的学科体系和开拓创新的人才队伍。</span></p><p><span>研究所承担了国家科技攻关和天津市重大科技项目，取得了丰硕的科研成果。获得了科技成果奖百余项。现有放射医用生物材料与核医疗课题组、辐射效应课题组、电离辐射损伤康复技术与应用课题组、多肽功能材料与创新药物课题组、共生微生物与放射医学课题组、生物化学与数字化诊疗课题组、智能放射增敏与防护医用材料课题组、细胞应激与衰老课题组、生物活性医用纳米材料课题组、辐射防治药物课题组、放射卫生课题组、肿瘤放疗增敏与新药研发课题组、环境暴露组与全生命周期健康课题组13个课题组。</span></p><p><span>在新的科研征程上，放射所勇于承担国家重大科研项目，为核事业的持续蓬勃发展和保驾护航做出新的贡献。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUwWFom9HfcXygqJ7iadeGAPcwnM6D4bLecN7flwDwC0Ak98XeNJfZsvw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUTsiadX2jOF7031l9a9P8iabypmnK8nSSfsNTr8dGTVsgWlrUvCd76o2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUHoLibLfKprcvzUdUmXvHulDjMC83Ylkib1qiaGfbFibg17u2khiaX7ZpAfQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>类别</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>100106</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>放射医学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>077806</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>放射医学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>100402</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>劳动卫生与环境卫生学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>083100</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>生物医学工程</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>107200</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>生物医学工程</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>071010</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>生物化学与分子生物学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>100701</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>药物化学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>100702</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>药剂学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>100706</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>药理学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>学术型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>105300</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>公共卫生</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>105500</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>药学</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><section><p><span>专业型</span></p></section></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUTsiadX2jOF7031l9a9P8iabypmnK8nSSfsNTr8dGTVsgWlrUvCd76o2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUHoLibLfKprcvzUdUmXvHulDjMC83Ylkib1qiaGfbFibg17u2khiaX7ZpAfQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUtI0Up4QNjJ1UrYPWdTMdXUd7rL97PygBcHeoTiaibp7DMO4tqsmFpGzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>请扫描二维码查看</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUTsiadX2jOF7031l9a9P8iabypmnK8nSSfsNTr8dGTVsgWlrUvCd76o2w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营活动详情</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUHoLibLfKprcvzUdUmXvHulDjMC83Ylkib1qiaGfbFibg17u2khiaX7ZpAfQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>在本次夏令营活动中您将走进实验室，了解各专业发展历程，聆听专题报告，参与学术交流。同时向有志于将来免试推荐或报考我单位研究生的优秀本科生提供深入了解本单位的机会。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>招收对象</span></strong></p></span></section></section><section><p><span>拟招收招生相关专业在校本科生30名。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></span></section></section><section><p><span>1.生物医学、生命科学、药学、生物医学工程、医学等相关专业大三、大四在校本科生（2026年6月本科毕业的在校学生）。</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优异，对科学研究工作有浓厚的兴趣，立志将来投身科学研究。</span></p><p><span>3.有直接推免外校研究生资格的优秀本科生优先。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></span></section></section><section><p><span>请扫描二维码进行网上报名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUchMu8RicNIHDYln0W7Kib2UNPib38oJLpiapuKL6wgqC61hDP6YVM5twew/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>报名后提交附照片的个人简历一份，成绩单及佐证材料一份，所有材料合成一个PDF文件，文件命名：姓名+学校，发送至邮箱fengziou@irm-cams.ac.cn。</span></p><p><span>收到个人简历及成绩单以后将统一筛查，待通过筛查后公布入营名单。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></p></span></section></section><section><p><span>报名截止6月25日：填写并提交报名表及相关资料。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>5</span></p></section><span title=\"\"><p><strong><span>招生咨询方式</span></strong></p></span></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：冯老师  杨老师</span></p><p><span>电 话：022-85683048</span></p><p><span>招生宣传微信群二维码</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxU8hI5W7hao2F8NiahrkRIR7Nmia0bHUibGsNqoyJdtFgLW6YmNZZAqljiag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>E-MAIL：fengziou@irm-cams.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>地址：天津市南开区白堤路238号 教育处 </span></p><p><span>邮编：300192</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqMTJAbFYicgya7JzvXtsdFxUo679MAoqIibh6yFFk6iacKrTKIuiaUiaIHLViavOtzja98iaUTDFUUAp3ZicA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>文字：冯子鸥</span></p><p><span>编辑：张明轩</span></p><p><span>校对：教育处</span></p><p><span>审核：刘强</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/hj49ded3eqPQp1RjhtFRvh68PzRRA0pV7cjllr8cVJFG61TkmHJz9KViau9ibb2JGv4MeOzvSaic9Vbum1XyCibvBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a31b1c40cd52d8ce694a1f7b9432a842c6febc5b3114e12ff798efccc39ac73d","textLength":1675,"sourceSha256":"994a14cb0f69f8f07fd9c5e5ea0639c28be3e6243470c0032698a654176599cf","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4e6a6a4c70bf2e0d9d97","title":"2025年北京协和医学院放射医学研究所2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:21.458641+00:00"}
